OL,3,GNEWSA'One disaster after another' -
OL,4,ARenfrew locals frustrated by bridge
OL,5,Aclosure
OL,6,
OL,7,FPeople in Renfrew say they have been
OL,8,Fhit with "one disaster after another"
OL,9,Fafter recent storms resulted in the
OL,10,Fclosure of the bridge linking the town
OL,11,Fto Yoker and Clydebank.
OL,13,FBusiness owners told the BBC they fear
OL,14,Fthe Renfrew Bridge closure - which is
OL,15,Fto last for months - will result in a
OL,16,Fbig drop in trade, just days after
OL,17,Fshops and restaurants were flooded.
OL,19,FOther local residents said it will now
OL,20,Ftake them much longer to visit sick
OL,21,Ffamily members in the Queen Elizabeth
OL,22,FUniversity Hospital.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
