OL,3,GNEWSA'One disaster after another' -
OL,4,ARenfrew locals frustrated by bridge
OL,5,Aclosure
OL,6,
OL,7,FRenfrewshire Council said earlier this
OL,8,Fweek that the electrical systems that
OL,9,Foperate the bridge, which opened in May
OL,10,Flast year, had suffered serious water
OL,11,Fdamage during the storms.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
